<title>USA: Hills Stores Co Oct same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Hills Stores Co Oct same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $153.1     $146.3     + 4.6	+ 2.6</p>
<p>Quarter	   $461.0	448.0     + 2.9	+ 1.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,219.8   $1,200.3     + 1.6	- 1.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended  Nov. 2, 1996.</p>
